e, "fontSize": 19.0, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "信号质量 = 背景 × 位置 × 形态\n三者相乘，缺一个就是零", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0036", "originalText": "信号质量 = 背景 × 位置 × 形态\n三者相乘，缺一个就是零", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 17.1}, {"id": "e0038", "type": "text", "x": 95.82499999999993, "y": 474.0, "width": 696.3500000000001, "height": 25.650000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 86759, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 19.0, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "三道闸把「感觉」替换成「清单」——这是对抗情绪的唯一工程化方法（第 7 章）", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "三道闸把「感觉」替换成「清单」——这是对抗情绪的唯一工程化方法（第 7 章）", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 17.1}, {"id": "title000", "type": "text", "x": 60.0, "y": 14, "width": 768.0, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 99991, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "判定框架：背景 × 位置 × 形态——三道闸按顺序过，任何一道不过就放弃", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "判定框架：背景 × 位置 × 形态——三道闸按顺序过，任何一道不过就放弃", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 23}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "zoom": {"value": 1}}, "files": {}}